Tailspin Toys must block the creation of storage accounts when the HTTPS-only property is not enabled. Both conditions in the rule must be true for a resource to match.

How should you complete the policy rule? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

```json
{
  "mode": "All",
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "[[1]]": [
        { "field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts" },
        { "field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/supportsHttpsTrafficOnly", "notEquals": "true" }
      ]
    },
    "then": { "effect": "[[2]]" }
  }
}
```
